{"abstract":[{"text":"Move a playback session between the immersive player and a window without losing the stream.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager"},{"type":"text","text":" belongs to the rendering context it was built for. The context is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fixed at init through its "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SurfaceContext"},{"type":"text","text":": a Compositor Services layer for the fully"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendered immersive player, a RealityKit entity for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VideoPlayerComponent"},{"type":"text","text":" content, or no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"context at all for the windowed Metal surface behind "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/GeometryVideoView"},{"type":"text","text":". None of those can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"follow the viewer into a different scene, so letting someone move a video from an immersive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"space into a window means building a second manager for the new surface."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What that costs you is everything the first manager was holding: the playhead, whether it was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"playing, the selected camera, the audio and subtitle languages, and which ad breaks have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already been seen. The manager cannot carry them across — it is going away — so hold that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state outside it, and put it back once the new manager is streaming. This guide covers the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hand-over; "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching"},{"type":"text","text":" is the different case of keeping one manager and changing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the video underneath it."}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The visionOS demo app in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Examples\/visionOS\/DemoApp"},{"type":"text","text":" implements this end to end:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PlayerCoordinator"},{"type":"text","text":" drives the swap, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PlaybackSession"},{"type":"text","text":" holds the session across it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PlaybackRestorePoint"},{"type":"text","text":" is the snapshot below, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WindowPlayerView"},{"type":"text","text":" hosts the windowed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player. The session types live in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Examples\/common"},{"type":"text","text":", shared with the iOS demo."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note"},{"text":"Ending the Old Manager Without Ending the Content","type":"heading","anchor":"Ending-the-Old-Manager-Without-Ending-the-Content","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Take the state you need off the old manager, then tear it down with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/stop(notifyEnded:)"},{"type":"text","text":". Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"notifyEnded: false"},{"type":"text","text":" so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/isVideoEnded"},{"type":"text","text":" stays quiet — the video"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is not over, and a host that dismisses its player UI on that signal would close the scene you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are about to move into:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct SessionState {","    let position: Double","    let isPlaying: Bool","    let cameraId: Int?","    let audioLanguage: String","    let subtitlesLanguage: String","    let playedAdBreakIds: Set<String>","}","","func snapshot(of player: YBVRPlayerManager) -> SessionState {","    SessionState(","        position: player.videoPosition.value,","        isPlaying: player.videoStatus.value != .paused,","        cameraId: player.currentCamera()?.id,","        audioLanguage: player.currentAudioLanguagePublisher.value,","        subtitlesLanguage: player.currentSubtitlesLanguagePublisher.value,","        playedAdBreakIds: player.ads.playedIds.value","    )","}","","pending = snapshot(of: player)","player.stop(notifyEnded: false)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Restoring on the New Manager","type":"heading","anchor":"Restoring-on-the-New-Manager","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build the new manager with the surface context for the scene you are moving into, then replay"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the snapshot once "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/startStream(video:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" has returned:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let player = YBVRPlayerManager(videoConfig: .defaultConfig, surfaceContext: context)","player.ads.markPlayed(pending.playedAdBreakIds)","","try await player.startStream(video: video, signaling)","","if let camera = pending.cameraId.flatMap({ id in player.cameras().first { $0.id == id } }) {","    await player.selectCamera(camera: camera)","}","if pending.position > 0 {","    player.seek(to: CMTimeMakeWithSeconds(pending.position, preferredTimescale: 1000))","}","await player.setAudioLanguage(language: pending.audioLanguage)","await player.setSubtitlesLanguage(language: pending.subtitlesLanguage)","","pending.isPlaying ? player.play() : player.pause()"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Seek once the stream is actually ready — waiting for "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/videoStatus"},{"type":"text","text":" to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"report "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ready"},{"type":"text","text":" is enough — or the seek lands on an item that has no seekable range yet."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Live content without time shifting cannot be resumed at a position; check"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Video\/isTimeShiftingAllowed"},{"type":"text","text":" before restoring one, and let the new player join at the live"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge otherwise."}]},{"text":"Ads Across the Swap","type":"heading","anchor":"Ads-Across-the-Swap","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/markPlayed(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is the one restore step that has to happen "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"new manager opens its stream, so call it as soon as the manager exists."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two things go wrong without it. A pre-roll is armed at position zero on the fresh manager and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plays again the moment content starts. And the restore seek jumps forward over any mid-roll"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the viewer has already watched, which is indistinguishable from someone skipping over one —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/playsMissedMidRollsOnSeek"},{"type":"text","text":" re-arms it and it plays a second time."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Marking the ids from "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/playedIds"},{"type":"text","text":" drops those breaks from the schedule and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes them out of the catch-up."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The schedule itself does not survive either: hand the new manager its breaks with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/schedule(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" the same way you did the first one. Order does not matter —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"marking before or after scheduling both work, and so does marking before the stream opens."}]},{"text":"Surfaces Draw Different Things","type":"heading","anchor":"Surfaces-Draw-Different-Things","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not every surface renders the same overlays, so what your UI has to supply changes with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode. Ask the manager rather than assuming:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/surfaceRendersSubtitles","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" for the immersive Compositor"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Services renderer, which burns cues into the video. On the windowed and RealityKit surfaces"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":", and the cue from ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/currentSubtitleCue","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is yours to place."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/surfaceRendersControlRoomMiniScreens","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says whether"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/showCRMiniScreens(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/hitTestCRMiniScreen(rayDirection:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" do anything. Where it is ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"build the mini screens from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/controlRoomSelectorViewModel()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ControlRoomView","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Re-binding Your Subscriptions","anchor":"Re-binding-Your-Subscriptions"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every publisher you were observing belonged to the old manager. Cancel those subscriptions as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"part of the swap and re-subscribe to the new manager, exactly as you would around a content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"switch. Anything you cached — the surface controller from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/getSurfaceController()"},{"type":"text","text":", a control room view model, a renderer — has to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be re-read too."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A counter that increments on every swap makes this easy to drive from SwiftUI: observe it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and rebuild your bindings whenever it changes."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode"},"metadata":{"title":"Switching Player Mode","modules":[{"name":"YBVRAppleSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"article","sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Guides","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Drm"],"anchor":"Guides"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/switchingplayermode"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager/videoStatus":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"videoStatus","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CurrentValueSubject","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Combine19CurrentValueSubjectC"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"VideoStatus","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12YBVRAppleSDK11VideoStatusO"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Never","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5NeverO"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Current video status. Can be "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ready"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"paused"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"buffering"}],"title":"videoStatus","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/videoStatus","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvrplayermanager\/videostatus","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager/isVideoEnded":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isVideoEnded","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Combine18PassthroughSubjectC"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Never","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5NeverO"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"isVideoEnded","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/isVideoEnded","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvrplayermanager\/isvideoended","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager/surfaceRendersControlRoomMiniScree